Z||000005||2xsess||12-20-2000||11:28 PM||||My friends mother-in-law had one that she let him drive a few times. He loved it. <P>I watched one of the car shows review them and they were pleased with it as far as I remember.<P>They cost in the high $30s-low$40s as Tina already posted (doh on my part)<P>The Kompressor is a reference to the supercharged engine.<P>Get a Yellow one   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 12-21-2000).]||||reg||1
